33/stats.htm#25018">"Understanding=20
        Statistics"</A><A=20
        =
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#25018"></A>=20

        <LI class=3DNL type=3Ddisc><A name=3D29647></A><A=20
