        </LI></UL></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></DIV><A =
name=3D25056></A><!--TOC=3Dh2-"25056"-->
<H3 class=3DH2><FONT face=3D"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" =
color=3D#330099>Missing=20
Statistics</FONT></H3><!--/TOC=3Dh2--><A name=3D25057></A>
<P class=3DBP>When statistics do not exist, the optimizer uses the =
default values=20
shown in <A=20
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#25064">Table&nbsp;3-4</A>=20
and <A=20
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#25064">Table&nbsp;3-4</A>.</P>
<H5 class=3DTT><A name=3D36410></A><A name=3D36373></A><STRONG><FONT=20
face=3D"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><EM>Table 3-3 Default Table Values =
When=20
