<H3 class=3DH2><FONT face=3D"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" =
color=3D#330099>Verifying=20
Histogram Statistics</FONT></H3><!--/TOC=3Dh2--><A name=3D27491></A>
<P class=3DBP>To verify that histogram statistics are available, query =
the data=20
dictionary's <CODE>DBA_HISTOGRAMS</CODE> table, using a statement =
similar to <A=20
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#32924">Example&nbsp;3-7</A>.</P><A=20
name=3D32924></A>
<H4 class=3DET><FONT face=3D"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><EM>Example =
3-7 Verifying=20
Histogram Statistics</EM></FONT></H4><PRE class=3DCE><A =
name=3D30255></A>SQL&gt; SELECT ENDPOINT_NUMBER, ENDPOINT_VALUE=20
<A name=3D30256></A>     FROM DBA_HISTOGRAMS=20
<A name=3D30257></A>     WHERE TABLE_NAME =3D"SO_LINES_ALL" AND =
COLUMN_NAME=3D"S2"=20
<A name=3D30253></A>     ORDER BY ENDPOINT_NUMBER;=20
<A name=3D27495></A>=20
</PRE><A name=3D27496></A>
<P class=3DBP>This query returns the following typical data:</P><PRE =
class=3DCE><A name=3D27497></A>ENDPOINT_NUMBER   ENDPOINT_VALUE
<A name=3D27498></A>---------------  ---------------
<A name=3D27499></A>          1365                 4
<A name=3D27500></A>          1370                 5
<A name=3D27501></A>          2124                 8
<A name=3D27502></A>          2228                18
<A name=3D27503></A>
</PRE><A name=3D33055></A>
<P class=3DBP>One row corresponds to one bucket in the histogram. =
Consider the=20
differences between <CODE>ENDPOINT_NUMBER</CODE> values in <A=20
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#32924">Example&nbsp;3-7</A>=20
listed in <A=20
href=3D"http://www.cise.ufl.edu/help/database/oracle-docs/server.920/a965=
33/stats.htm#33026">Table&nbsp;3-5</A>.</P>
<H5 class=3DTT><A name=3D35514></A><A name=3D33026></A><STRONG><FONT=20
face=3D"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><EM>Table 3-5 ENDPOINT_NUMBER=20
Differences</EM></FONT></STRONG></H5>
