33/stats.htm#33026">Table&nbsp;3-5</A>=20
shows that the buckets hold very different numbers of values. The data =
is=20
skewed: 754 values are between 5 and 8, but only 104 are between 8 and =
18. More=20
buckets should be used.</P><!-- Start Footer --></DIV>
